        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-16T07:28:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This method is not pure so it should not be called liberally from various places with an expectation it returns the same value as last time. I think you need to have some mechanism in place that guarantees the basis for the VpnTransportInfo is the same that was sent to IKE, and such a guarantee necessarily involves not calling an impure method multiple times in different places.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3498,
        "startChar": 40,
        "endLine": 3498,
        "endChar": 73
      },
      "revId": "65ab708b8649cecc0f933063e4126d6ebe22a727",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8406743a_676be2ef",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/connectivity/Vpn.java",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 3498,
      "author": {
        "id": 1304263
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-16T11:02:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I combine maybeMigrateIkeSession and UpdateVpnTransportInfo together so that the keepalive value will be always the same whenever we set the keeplaive in setNetwork.  See if this address your concern.",
      "parentUuid": "615a8201_9a4a6e2c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3498,
        "startChar": 40,
        "endLine": 3498,
        "endChar": 73
      },
      "revId": "65ab708b8649cecc0f933063e4126d6ebe22a727",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f7ab6dc8_142c9454",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/connectivity/Vpn.java",
