        "id": 1304263
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-17T07:18:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Update to call it only once and take the keepalive timeout value as a parameter into maybeMigrateIkeSession() and updateVpnTransportInfoAndNetCap(). Does it works better to you?",
      "parentUuid": "f7ab6dc8_142c9454",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3498,
        "startChar": 40,
        "endLine": 3498,
        "endChar": 73
      },
      "revId": "65ab708b8649cecc0f933063e4126d6ebe22a727",
